WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:03,600
It's really troublesome for you, Mr. Zhang. Isn't it troublesome?

2
00:00:04,330 --> 00:00:09,700
They are all working for General Shen.

3
00:00:10,410 --> 00:00:12,170
Then I'll come over in a few days to pick them up.

4
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:16,350
Is there anything else wrong?

5
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:18,260
Nothing happened

6
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:23,540
I just want to help Mr. Zhang with some suggestions.

7
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:26,700
Didn’t Mr. Zhang mention it before?

8
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:29,260
Is a man named Li Dao born with supernatural powers?

9
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:31,390
Is there any problem?

10
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:33,060
No problem

11
00:00:34,010 --> 00:00:35,170
That's the kind of person I think

12
00:00:35,170 --> 00:00:36,890
He is a natural warrior on the battlefield.

13
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:39,740
Personally, I think Huangsha Town Daying

14
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:42,300
This kind of challenging place suits him better

15
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:44,820
I don’t know what Mr. Zhang thinks.

16
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:46,100
Daying, Huangsha Town

17
00:00:46,580 --> 00:00:49,260
That was the magnetic head camp with the highest mortality rate under the Zhenbei Houhui

18
00:00:50,250 --> 00:00:52,210
Of course that doesn't mean this camp is weak.

19
00:00:52,210 --> 00:00:53,410
So the mortality rate is high

20
00:00:53,970 --> 00:00:55,050
On the combat effectiveness of soldiers

21
00:00:55,330 --> 00:00:56,850
The actual combat strength of the Huangsha Town camp

22
00:00:56,850 --> 00:00:58,450
In hundreds of camps throughout Yunzhou

23
00:00:58,450 --> 00:00:59,890
It can also be ranked in the top ten.
